@segment   tuning-hum
@title     The Tuning Hum
@levels    F18
@duration  ~1m30s

say Breathe with the waves a moment longer.
pause 4
say Now let the hum rise. Not from your chest this time — let it climb, through your throat, into your jaw. A little higher, a little brighter than before.
pause 5
say Feel where it changes as it moves. That shift is the instrument retuning itself to where you are now.
hold 60
say Let the hum settle. Let your breath return to its own quiet rhythm.
pause 6
